@startuml class-after
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 110
skinparam nodesep 90

interface Cell <<interface>> {
  + figureNextState(north : Cell, south : Cell,\n    east : Cell, west : Cell,\n    northeast : Cell, northwest : Cell,\n    southeast : Cell, southwest : Cell) : boolean
  + transition() : boolean
  + holdNextState(location : Point, alive : boolean) : boolean
  + redraw(g : Graphics, here : Rectangle, drawAll : boolean)
  + colorAt(row : int, column : int) : Color
  + userClicked(here : Point, surface : Rectangle)
  + transfer(memento : Storable, upperLeftCorner : Point, doLoad : boolean) : boolean
  + clear()
}

class Neighborhood {
  + figureNextState(north : Cell, south : Cell,\n    east : Cell, west : Cell,\n    northeast : Cell, northwest : Cell,\n    southeast : Cell, southwest : Cell) : boolean
  + transition() : boolean
  + holdNextState(location : Point, alive : boolean) : boolean
  + redraw(g : Graphics, here : Rectangle, drawAll : boolean)
}

class Resident {
  ~ {static} LIVE_COLOR : Color
  - {static} DEAD_COLOR : Color
  - amAlive : boolean
  - willBeAlive : boolean
  - age : int
  - heldThisGeneration : boolean
  ~ {static} setColorPolicy(policy : CellColorPolicy)
  ~ {static} colorChangesWithAge() : boolean
  + figureNextState(north : Cell, south : Cell,\n    east : Cell, west : Cell,\n    northeast : Cell, northwest : Cell,\n    southeast : Cell, southwest : Cell) : boolean
  + transition() : boolean
  + holdNextState(location : Point, alive : boolean) : boolean
  + redraw(g : Graphics, here : Rectangle, drawAll : boolean)
  + colorAt(row : int, column : int) : Color
  + userClicked(here : Point, surface : Rectangle)
  + transfer(blob : Storable, upperLeft : Point, doLoad : boolean) : boolean
  + clear()
}

interface CellColorPolicy <<interface>> {
  + colorOf(age : int) : Color
  + changesWithAge() : boolean
}

class FixedColorPolicy {
  - color : Color
  + FixedColorPolicy(color : Color)
  + colorOf(age : int) : Color
  + changesWithAge() : boolean
}

class CyclingColorPolicy {
  - period : int
  - colors : Color[]
  + CyclingColorPolicy(period : int, colors : Color...)
  + colorOf(age : int) : Color
  + changesWithAge() : boolean
}

class Universe {
  - Universe()
  + liveCells() : boolean[][]
  + notifyBoardChanged(kind : BoardChangeEvent.Kind)
  - notifyBoardChanged(kind : BoardChangeEvent.Kind, before : boolean[][])
  # paintComponent(g : Graphics)
  - refreshNow()
  - useColorPolicy(policy : CellColorPolicy)
}

class Clock {
  + tick()
}

Cell <|.left. Neighborhood
Cell <|.. Resident
Neighborhood "<U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003>1" *-left-> "<U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003>64\ngrid" Cell
Universe "1<U+2003>" -right-> "outermostCell\n1<U+2003>" Cell
Universe .left.> Clock : <<use>>
Universe ..> Resident : <<create, use>>
CellColorPolicy <|.right. FixedColorPolicy
CellColorPolicy <|.. CyclingColorPolicy
Resident "<U+2003><U+2003><U+2003>*" --> "<u>colorPolicy</u>\n1" CellColorPolicy
Universe ..> FixedColorPolicy : <U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><<create>>
Universe ..> CyclingColorPolicy : <<create>>
Resident ..> FixedColorPolicy : <<create>>
Universe ..> CellColorPolicy : <<use>><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003>


note right of Resident
  colorPolicy는 모든 셀이 함께 쓰는 static 참조다.
  redraw()와 colorAt()이
  colorPolicy.colorOf(age)로 색을 받는다.
  colorAt()은 통계 기능이,
  holdNextState()와 heldThisGeneration은
  Freezing 기능이 더했다
end note
note left of Universe
  Resident를 프로토타입으로 판을 만들고,
  시계에 틱 리스너를 등록한다.
  Color 메뉴에서 규칙을 만들어
  useColorPolicy()로 바꿔 끼우고,
  틱마다 colorChangesWithAge()에 묻는다
end note
@enduml
